  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7202.05 Head of law enforcement agency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7202.05 “Head of law enforcement agency” means the chief law enforcement officer of the law enforcement agency, or his or her designee.\n\nSource. #12648, eff 10-22-18",
